line	<str>Talk to Aurel again to get a crate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Add 10 bronze axes, 10 raw mackerels or 10 snails (depending on what is asked), and 3 tinderboxes to the crate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Aurel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Cornelius in the bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a hammer with 2 planks, 1 swamp paste, and 8 nails on the broken bank booth</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a hammer with 3 planks and 12 nails on the damaged wall outside.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Cornelius to recruit him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Razvan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repair the furnace to the south-east. Use your steel bars, then coal, then tinderbox on the furnace.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Gadderanks in the general store.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Vampyre Juvinate in the store.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Wiskit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the two juvinates and then Gadderanks (you'll need a silver weapon or Wolfbane dagger or Efaritay's aid to damage them).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Gadderanks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the hideout where the quest started. (The room under the Canifis pub)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Polmafi Ferdygris.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan Strom to go on a simplified version of Temple Trekking and take either the short or long route. (you can't bring a pet - it must be banked!)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the Vampyre Juvinates before they can kill Ivan Strom.</str>
line	
line	<str>After you're done escorting Ivan, talk to Drezel in the underground temple for a key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the key on the keyhole on the eastern wall and climb down the trapdoor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the bookcases in the hidden room until you find The sleeping seven (The title of the book at the top when reading it is "The Sleeping Seven"). Read it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the room under the Canifis pub, then go to the blockaded cave entrance just south-east of the wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a hammer on the wooden boards and enter the cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your soft clay on the coffin to make a rod mould.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to any furnace with your mould, a silver bar, a mithril bar and a sapphire, and craft a <col=800000>silvthrill rod</col>. (Fairy ring DKR for <col=800000>Edgeville Furnace</col>.)</col>
